<title>INDIA: India produced 145.56 kg gold in April.</title>
<headline>India produced 145.56 kg gold in April.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>India produced 145.56 kg of gold in April 1997 as against 137.99 kg in April 1996, a government statement said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>				     Production</p>
<p>				April 97     April 96</p>
<p>- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -  BGML			  101.36	 91.71</p>
<p> HGML			   44.20	 46.28</p>
<p>- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -  Total			 145.56	137.99</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures are in kg and provisional.</p>
<p>	    BGML: Bharat Gold Mines Limited.</p>
<p>	    HGML: Hutti Gold Mines Limited.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
